  {"date": "2025-07-09", "venue": "Jerome Schottenstein Center", "city": "Columbus", "state": "OH", "gap": 17, "set": "1", "jamchart": true, "jam": "Cool play coasts atop a mellow groove which finds Trey strumming his way into strong, protracted and, at times, melodic soloing. Offset by measured, calibrated play, Page, near the 6:30 mark, pushes for 'brighter' sounds, his synth not so much leading the way as offering direction. Trey plays with this idea before dropping into a lower register, runs through the tune's signature line, and guides the song to a close.", "prev": "Martian Monster", "next": "Strawberry Letter 23", "nb": 1},
